/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:5:> 提取的原语（去重）：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:6:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:7:> - 操作类：滑动(slide), 平铺(tiling), 印章覆盖(stamp), 像素放大(pixel_upscale), 形状匹配(shape_match), 旋转(rotate), 翻转(flip), 连线(connect), 裁剪(crop), 连通检测(connected_component_detection), 计数(counting), 平移(translate), 擦除(erase), 填充(fill), 填入(insert), 稠密化(densify), 加厚(thicken), 射线延伸(ray_extend), 重涂色(recolor), 路径绘制(path_drawing), 传播(propagate), 逐列填充(column_fill), 反转(invert), 坐标压缩(coordinate_compression)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:8:> - 对象类：稀疏线段(sparse_line), 对角轨迹(diagonal_trace), 控制像素(control_pixel), 源图案(source_pattern), 框架(frame), 孔洞槽位(hole_slot), 拼块(piece), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 线段(line_segment), 矩形区域(rectangular_region), 标记色连通体(marker_color_connected_object), 前景对象(foreground_object), 全宽条纹(full_width_stripe), 空心十字标记(hollow_plus_marker), 最大连通分量(largest_component), 角落控制点(corner_control), 三角区域(triangle_region), 稀疏边框(sparse_frame), 稀疏精灵体(sparse_sprite), 边缘标记(edge_marker), 障碍像素(obstacle_pixel), 底行标记像素(bottom_row_marker_pixel), 纵向色带(vertical_color_band), 前景格子体(foreground_lattice), 像素行(pixel_row), 封闭框(enclosing_frame), 内层前景(inner_foreground), 主色像素(dominant_pixel), 干扰色像素(distractor_pixel), 种子图案(seed_pattern), 矩形空腔(rectangular_cavity), 墙壁(wall), 顶行色序(top_row_color_sequence), 分隔行(separator_row), 分隔线(separator_line), 定位标记(anchor_marker), 调色板行(palette_row), 标记竖条(marker_bar), 精灵体(sprite), 行标签(row_label), 列标签(column_label), 内部单元格(interior_cell)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:9:> - 空间关系类：逐步平移(stepwise_translation), 像素到块映射(pixel_block_mapping), 缩放对应(scale_correspondence), 同行列对齐(row_col_aligned), 同行同列对齐(same_row_column_alignment), 计数决定尺寸(count_determines_size), 位置顺序(position_order), 投射(projection), 底行锚定(bottom_row_anchored), 仅对角邻接(diagonal_only_adj), 逐行独立(row_independent), 图案填满空腔(pattern_fills_cavity), 块距离(block_distance), 以缺口为中心(centered_on_gap), 无重叠拼合(non_overlap_pack), 互补拼合(complement_fit), 行列交叉(row_col_intersection)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/004.md:10:> - 条件类：颜色数决定尺寸(color_count_size), 控制色选中则印章(stamp_where_control), 八方向匹配(all_orientations_matching), 首尾跨度填充(span_fill_between), 指定面积筛选(specific_area_filter), 最大计数选择(max_count_selection), 位移等于面积(shift_equals_area), 仅相邻锚点间连接(connect_only_between_adjacent_anchors), 最大分量保留(largest_component_kept), 等距排列入框(equidist_in_frame), 障碍决定转向(obstacle_turn), 底行标记选定列(bottom_marker_selects_column), 逐行交替方向(alternating_direction_per_row), 对角邻接背景着色(diagonal_bg_color), 主色与背景互换(native_bg_swap), 保持种子相位(preserve_seed_phase), 分隔下循环填色(below_separator_cycle_fill), 沙漏距离谓词(hourglass_distance_predicate), 逐行扩展楔形(row_expand_wedge), 最密堆叠最小框(densest_minimal_bbox), 标签同色时填充(labels_match_fill)
