/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/008.md:8:> - 空间关系类：column_membership, opposite_pairing, largest_by_size, same_color_four_corner, interior_region, border_aligned, alignment, containment, self_complementary, pattern_match, array_layout, collision_blocking, inside_bounding_box, missing_corner_pos, legend_order_to_slot, diagonal_pairing, translate_align, dihedral_equiv, reachability
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/008.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：column_rank_to_color, inward_trails_meet_mark, pattern_once, outlier_selection, draw_rect_via_channel, frame_interior_only, repeated_color_moves, disagreement_cells_painted, marker_short_axis_div, tile_at_foreground_positions, transform_match_fill, color_count_repetition, gravity_far_to_near, rotations_pinwheel, aspect_ratio_mirror_axis, flip_by_missing_corner, legend_maps_color, processing_order_protection, missing_color_fill_slot, fragment_anchor_place, equiv_colored, ignore_distractors, distance_ranked_fill
