/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:4:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:5:> 提取的原语（去重）：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:6:> - 操作类：连线/draw_line, 重涂色/recolor, 镜像/reflect, 平铺/tile, 计数/counting, 填充/fill, 外推/extrapolate, 平移/translate, 补全/complete, 裁剪/crop, 异或/xor, 印章覆盖/stamp, 拉伸/stretch, 排序/sort, 旋转/rotate, 放置/place, 描边/border_drawing, 堆叠/stack, 绕障重绘/reroute_around_obstacle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:7:> - 对象类：标记像素/marker_pixel, 线段/line_segment, 精灵体/sprite, 正方形块/square_block, 条形图/bar_chart, 干扰体/distractor, 帧序列/frame_sequence, 内部精灵/inner_sprite, 锚矩形/anchor_rectangle, 控制条/control_bar, 同心方框层/concentric_layer, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 连通分量/connected_component, 边框边/frame_side, 内部像素/interior_pixel, 空白区域/blank_region, 实心正方形/solid_square, 嵌套遮罩/nested_mask, 分隔列/divider_column, 槽位/slot, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 网格线/lattice_line, 缺失交叉点/missing_intersection, 分隔行/separator_row, 掩码/mask, 色块条带/color_stripe, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 边框/border_frame, 障碍精灵体/obstacle_sprite, 锚定条/anchor_bar, 图例面板/legend_panel, 单元精灵/unit_sprite, 框架模板/frame_template
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:8:> - 空间关系类：两点直线路径/straight_two_point, 阵列排布/array_layout, 等间距排列/equal_spacing, 对角对称/diagonal_symmetry, 深度排序/depth_order, 面积排名/area_ranking, 颜色匹配边/color_match_side, 四角围合/four_corner_bound, 对齐/alignment, 按数量排序/count_ordering, 分区/partition, 包围盒映射/bbox_mapping, 标记行指示顺序/marker_row_order, 排序/ordering, 边界贴合/boundary_hugging, 锚点对齐/anchor_alignment, 包围盒/bounding_box
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:9:> - 条件类：按原色区分涂色/recolor_by_origin, 交替翻转平铺/alternating_reflections_tiling, 计数编码为条长/count_as_bar_length, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 匀速运动延续/constant_motion, 控制条周期延伸/control_periodic, 层色序内外翻转/reverse_layer_colors, 分量最大矩形涂/largest_rect_per_component, 朝匹配边移动/move_toward_match, 全黑窗口换前景色/black_to_foreground, 忽略非正方形/ignore_non_square, 标记选槽接收精灵/marker_selects_slot_for_sprite, 线段连接再填充/connect_then_fill, 背景色空洞/background_hole, 逐像素异或输出/pixelwise_xor_output, 前景最多者选出/max_foreground_count_selected, 标记编码位置/marker_encodes_position, 时钟指针编码角度/clock_hand_encodes_rotation, 半区分色/half_color_split, 像素数守恒/pixel_count_conservation, 三点定矩形框/three_pts_define_rect, 整块移动保持内容/block_move_intact
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:10:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/055.md:11:> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。
