/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：无障碍通路(unobstructed_path), 块解码为掩码(decode_block_to_mask), 像素匹配掩码位置(pixels_match_mask_positions), 笛卡尔积缺位填充(cartesian_product_gap_fill), 标记最多者选取(rectangle_with_most_markers_selected), 已填瓦片填空槽(filled_tile_to_empty_slots), 调色带指定列色(palette_assigns_color), 计数渲染柱状图(counts_as_histogram), 孔洞位置等于坐标(hole_equals_coordinate), 最大边框内部提取(largest_frame_interior_extract), 面积决定填充色(area_determines_fill_color), 轴色决定旋转(axis_color_determines_rotation), 散落连接同色框边(scatter_connect_side), 色沿层序循环移(colors_cycle_by_nesting), 旋转镜像等价匹配(rotation_reflection_match), 恰一为前景(exactly_one_foreground), 凸起匹配标记列(projections_match_columns), 完全覆盖(full_coverage), 无重叠(no_overlap), 欧氏距离最小(minimum_euclidean_distance), 槽位位置决定颜色(slot_position_color), 标记接触即赋色(marker_touch_color)
