/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:5:> 提取的原语（去重）：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:6:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:7:> - 操作类：周期延伸(periodic_extension), 填充(fill), 压缩(compress), 重涂色(recolor), 计数(counting), 射线延伸(ray_extension), 擦除(erase), 平铺(tiling), 描边(mark_neighbors), 裁剪(crop), 提取(extract), 补全(completion), 印章覆盖(stamp/stamp_overlay), 连线(line_drawing/bridge_drawing), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 拼接(merge), 挖孔(punch_holes), 紧凑排列(compact_packing)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:8:> - 对象类：分隔列(separator_column), 色条(color_bar), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 十字分隔线(cross_separator), 四象限(quadrant), 连通分量(connected_component), 实心方块(filled_square), 射线(ray), 角括号(corner_bracket), 种子像素(seed_pixel), 多色对象(multicolor_obj), 侧边标记(side_marker), 面板区域(panel_region), 分隔线(separator_line), 网格单元(grid_cell), 模板精灵体(template_sprite), 不完整副本(partial_copy), 缺失掩码(missing_mask), 正交路径(orthogonal_path), 轮廓线(contour_line), 封闭背景区域(enclosed_bg_region), 源像素(source_pixel), 障碍块(blocker), 种子图案(seed_motif), 开放单元格(open_cell), 等分面板(equal_panel), 分隔条(separator_bar), 前景对象(foreground_object), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 边界(boundary), 遮挡像素(occluding_pixel), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 带框方块(framed_square), 控制序列(control_sequence), 单色块(monochrome_block), 模板图案(motif_stencil), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:9:> - 空间关系类：长度即周期(length_as_period), 行列交叉(row_col_intersection), 主色代表区域(dominant_per_region), 面积分类(area_classification), 中心向外辐射(radiate_from_center), 罗盘方向(compass_direction), 标记在括号内部(marker_inside_bracket), 对角邻接(diagonal_adjacency), 包含于(contained_in), 等分网格(equal_partition), 模板与副本匹配(template_copy_match), 经由中间点路由(routed_via_waypoint), 轮廓围合(contour_enclosure), 边缘起始(edge_origin), 单元格阵列(cell_array), 位序选择(positional_selection), 拓扑内外(topological_in_out), 对称轨道(symmetry_orbit), 行列对齐(row_column_alignment), 同色匹配(same_color_matching), 连通性(connectivity)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/031.md:10:> - 条件/判断类：近者优先(nearest_first_priority), 边缘标记笛卡尔积(edge_marker_cartesian_product), 去噪取主色(denoise_majority), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 面积决定颜色(area_determines_color), 排除中心像素(exclude_center_pixel), 按标记色选择同色(select_same_color_by_marker), 保留标记本身(preserve_marker_itself), 平铺后对角涂色(diagonal_marked_after_tiling), 接触侧定色(contact_side_color), 唯一单色单元(unique_mono_cell), 异常值选择(outlier_selection), 非标记精确匹配(non_marker_match), 先横后纵路由(horizontal_then_vertical), 小区域被填充(small_regions_filled), 对角方向(diagonal_direction), 障碍偏转绕行(obstacle_deflection), 同奇偶格接收副本(same_parity_receive_copy), 面板序号选对象(panel_selects_obj), 仅填封闭内部(fill_enclosed_only), 反射旋转定颜色(reflect_rotate_color), 访问顺序编码(visitation_order_encoding), 最近优先(nearest_preferred), 保持行列顺序(preserve_row_col_order), 面积大于一则涂(recolor_if_area_gt_one)
