/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/054.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：目标底边对齐/target_base_aligned, 开口朝向决定色/open_side_color, 按控制色重涂/recolor_by_control, 像素数编码旋转/pixel_count_encodes_rotation, 最小间距对触发/min_gap_triggered, 非背景处印章/stamp_at_nonbg, 固定步长平移/fixed_step_translate, 碰触后对侧放副本/touch_copy_opposite, 标记遮挡区域/marker_occludes_region, 跨色重叠变色/cross_color_overlap_recolor, 字形映射颜色行/glyph_maps_to_color_row, 异色包含则删/delete_if_contained_by_other_color, 对称性筛选目标/symmetry_filter, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 遇障碍截断/truncate_at_blocker, 碰撞停止/collision_stop, 面积序映射环/area_order_to_ring, 保留边框填内部/keep_border_fill_in
