/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/048.md:8:> - 空间关系类：separator_alignment, mirror_symmetry, frame_encloses_interior, corner_correspondence, same_color_pairing, axis_aligned, grid_partition, same_color_match, side_strip_align, gap_determines_ray, flip_symmetry, parallel_diagonal_band, border_interior_split, separator_partition, color_links_to_region, facing_gap, inside_bbox, cyclic_symmetry, adjacent_placement, nesting_hierarchy
